{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50862","headline":"省题诗二十一首 咏清 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 咏清","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洁澈浮天色，锵洋入乐声。\n露零金掌满，冰结玉壼盈。\n屏障排云母，帘栊动水精。\n南山秋雨霁，北牖晚风生。\n裴楷当年意，胡威近日名。\n未知尧舜化，寰宇一时清。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}